---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '@/config/site';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="reveal-on-scroll relative overflow-hidden rounded-[36px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#061029] via-[#0B1B3F] to-[#0F2452] px-6 py-14 text-center text-white shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 sm:px-12 sm:py-20">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_0%,rgba(37,99,235,0.45),transparent_65%)]"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-400/30 bg-blue-500/15 px-3.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-200 uppercase">
        Inicia tu Proyecto
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Cuéntame qué proceso necesitas resolver en tu negocio.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
        Conversemos sin compromiso sobre tu sistema web a medida, aplicación móvil o estrategia de rendimiento y posicionamiento.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/cotizar" class="btn-primary !px-7 !py-3.5 !text-base">
          <span>Solicitar Cotización Guiada</span>
          <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/20">
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.contact.whatsappUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors hover:bg-white/20"
        >
          WhatsApp Directo ({SITE_CONFIG.contact.phoneDisplay})
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
